{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S.E.M.I.</strong> is a cooperative online game about escaping from a special clinic. Here <strong>you and up to 3</strong> of your <span class=\"bb_strike\">feeble-minded</span> loyal friends in the role of patients fight with the staff and other patients and find yourself in unexpected situations. Teamwork is essential, as randomized events and experimental drugs will lead your party into unpredictable mayhem. Pop pills with your friends as you cooperate to <strong>gain your freedom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate in voice chat and <span class=\"bb_strike\">arrange sabotage</span>\u00a0help your friends pass through rooms, get out of traps and fight with opponents! In your arsenal: close combat, physics, amazing abilities and ... imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pills and get <strong>abilities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bipolar force</strong> is an invulnerable monster, then a helpless rag!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser astigmatism</strong> \u2014 two sights, one laser\u2026 Where will he shoot?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stendhal syndrome</strong> \u2014 are you looking at a painting? Now you're hysterical and destroying everything around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice's syndrome</strong> is either tiny or gigantic \u2014 have time to adjust!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madness is near! You and your friends can go crazy and start running, jumping and fighting, and your abilities will become uncontrollable. Do you want to take back control? <strong>Take the pills :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are randomly generated from rooms with changing gravity, traps, moving walls, and other &quot;pleasant&quot; surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful escape, you will receive a medical report: &quot;<i>The patient was stable until he started hitting the guards with a bottle. Diagnosis: Overmotivation</i>&quot; or something <strong>worse</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new costumes and decorations. Let each new escape be more stylish than the previous one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you and your friends be able to escape... or at least not go crazy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mental hospital! Here, your abilities are a lottery, and your friends can be the most dangerous opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957560?t=1761761149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957560?t=1761761149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/c8aef2aef9768bf7238d9a7861c463defa3fba74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761761149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/c8aef2aef9768bf7238d9a7861c463defa3fba74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761761149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3957630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c05ab8e83475b30a39906c37950e3b39.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S.E.M.I.</strong> is a cooperative online game about escaping from a special clinic. Here <strong>you and up to 3</strong> of your <span class=\"bb_strike\">feeble-minded</span> loyal friends in the role of patients fight with the staff and other patients and find yourself in unexpected situations. Teamwork is essential, as randomized events and experimental drugs will lead your party into unpredictable mayhem. Pop pills with your friends as you cooperate to <strong>gain your freedom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/cb627a7019c2ab10bcbfab75954ef730.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate in voice chat and <span class=\"bb_strike\">arrange sabotage</span>\u00a0help your friends pass through rooms, get out of traps and fight with opponents! In your arsenal: close combat, physics, amazing abilities and ... imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/c617c77a4eb43f2b9b98e83a150ea31f.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pills and get <strong>abilities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bipolar force</strong> is an invulnerable monster, then a helpless rag!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser astigmatism</strong> \u2014 two sights, one laser\u2026 Where will he shoot?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stendhal syndrome</strong> \u2014 are you looking at a painting? Now you're hysterical and destroying everything around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice's syndrome</strong> is either tiny or gigantic \u2014 have time to adjust!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f65b1b0c23980677d322aec62cef848f.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madness is near! You and your friends can go crazy and start running, jumping and fighting, and your abilities will become uncontrollable. Do you want to take back control? <strong>Take the pills :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f04403e41b3b98636a8028a1ffc9461d.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are randomly generated from rooms with changing gravity, traps, moving walls, and other &quot;pleasant&quot; surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/fcaace4b6e6e8cbae373c33ed42990cb.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful escape, you will receive a medical report: &quot;<i>The patient was stable until he started hitting the guards with a bottle. Diagnosis: Overmotivation</i>&quot; or something <strong>worse</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/18a2ffd531e5292662aa10ba1c03b5b7.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new costumes and decorations. Let each new escape be more stylish than the previous one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you and your friends be able to escape... or at least not go crazy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mental hospital! Here, your abilities are a lottery, and your friends can be the most dangerous opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.poster.avif?t=1761761149\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.webm?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/7788523ef7b1bddea49b53f3fb2ad1a4.mp4?t=1761761149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Two Horn Unicorn"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/51ca5044f7ca66e54c646bcafe7f2c01f3649fbf/header.jpg?t=1761761149","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3957560/834817668/a7fc67c652bfa9e3f18fce8c875c2ff7a99f0e13/1758109588/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758122537","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3957560/834817668/a7fc67c652bfa9e3f18fce8c875c2ff7a99f0e13/1758109588/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758122537","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3957560/834817668/a7fc67c652bfa9e3f18fce8c875c2ff7a99f0e13/1758109588/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758122537","id":257199740,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199740/movie480.mp4?t=1758122537","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199740/movie_max.mp4?t=1758122537"},"name":"S.E.M.I. - Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257199740/e057c226e660e4c0986c8d32ee3f4e940de57190/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758122537","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamst